   author = {Mengzhou Liao and Paolo Nicolini and Luojun Du and Jiahao Yuan and Shuopei Wang and Hua Yu and Jian Tang and Peng Cheng and Kenji Watanabe and Takashi Taniguchi and Lin Gu and Victor E. P. Claerbout and Andrea Silva and Denis Kramer and Tomas Polcar and Rong Yang and Dongxia Shi and Guangyu Zhang},
